// DevPilot AI — Architecture RAGOps  (Eraser diagram-as-code)
title RAGOps — Observabilité du système d'IA

colorMode bold
styleMode shadow
typeface clean
direction down

Sources [icon: database, color: green] {
  Qdrant [icon: database, label: "Qdrant health"]
  Postgres [icon: postgresql, label: "documents · chunks · evaluations · agent_runs"]
  Metrics [icon: prometheus, label: "Prometheus / Grafana"]
}

Services [icon: server, color: blue] {
  RagopsSvc [icon: activity, label: "ragops_service"]
  TracesSvc [icon: layers, label: "rag_traces_service"]
  AdminSvc [icon: settings, label: "admin_service"]
}

ControlTower [icon: monitor, color: purple] {
  Health [icon: heart, label: "Health Monitoring"]
  Coverage [icon: pie-chart, label: "Embedding Coverage"]
  Quality [icon: shield, label: "Evaluation Intelligence"]
  WorkspaceHealth [icon: grid, label: "Workspace Health (0–100)"]
  AgentMon [icon: bar-chart, label: "Agent Monitoring"]
  Failures [icon: alert-triangle, label: "Failure Center · retry"]
}

Qdrant > RagopsSvc
Postgres > TracesSvc
Postgres > AdminSvc
Metrics > Health
RagopsSvc > Health
RagopsSvc > Coverage
RagopsSvc > WorkspaceHealth
RagopsSvc > Failures
TracesSvc > Quality
AdminSvc > AgentMon
